#   byte-unchanged (sclkPin GPIO27, picoPin GPIO29, pociPin GPIO28, csnPin
#   GPIO16); only trailing comments and the HARDWARE NOTE prose differ.
#   EVIDENCE: build_ti.ps1 -Ble against a protocol-7 alp-sdk checkout
#   (ticlang 5.1.1, SysConfig 1.28.0) was run at built-from 3d963c98 itself --
#   i.e. with this commit's diff ABSENT -- and at the commit's own tree.  Both
#   produced the identical raw image
